1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,312
ArborKnowledge Studio makes professional
knowledge traceable, from the source onward.

2
00:00:05,512 --> 00:00:09,900
Built for professional tree care and designed
for human judgment.

3
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:12,343
Produced by RediON.

4
00:00:12,893 --> 00:00:18,918
Expertise is scattered across reports, research,
guidance and field experience.

5
00:00:19,048 --> 00:00:23,035
When we write, the evidence behind a claim can
disappear.

6
00:00:23,235 --> 00:00:27,710
Here, every source, statement and decision stays
connected.

7
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:33,735
First, we register a source with its origin,
usage rights and authority level.

8
00:00:33,935 --> 00:00:37,522
A fictional case becomes a set of knowledge
units.

9
00:00:37,652 --> 00:00:41,302
Each one links back to the precise place it came
from.

10
00:00:41,503 --> 00:00:45,240
The library shows which source supports every
statement.

11
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:50,590
In the editorial workspace, the knowledge units
are connected to a chapter.

12
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:54,490
Versions and comments leave a clear record of
changes.

13
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:57,940
Only a human reviewer can approve a chapter.

14
00:00:58,070 --> 00:01:02,858
That approval is an editorial decision, not a
professional certification.

15
00:01:03,058 --> 00:01:07,245
An approved book can be exported as an editable
Word document.

16
00:01:07,795 --> 00:01:10,908
The same evidence base can support a course.

17
00:01:11,108 --> 00:01:16,808
Before learning begins, the coverage view shows
what is supported and what still needs evidence.

18
00:01:17,008 --> 00:01:21,145
Progress stays local, and AI never changes it
silently.

19
00:01:21,695 --> 00:01:26,745
The vision is one controlled workflow for
sources, publishing and learning.

20
00:01:26,945 --> 00:01:31,420
Redion Cekrezi, full stack and applied AI
developer.

21
00:01:31,550 --> 00:01:33,700
Upgrade humans.

22
00:01:33,830 --> 00:01:35,818
Not replace them.
